NOTE ON GENERATED MEDIA ASSETS (그림·음성 에셋 라이선스 고지)

The MIT license above covers the SOURCE CODE of this repository.

The book illustrations (PNG) and narration/word audio (MP3) shipped in
`public/seed/` are MEDIA ASSETS generated by AI, not source code:

  - Illustrations : OpenAI image model `gpt-image-2` (via Codex CLI $imagegen)
  - Audio (TTS)   : OpenAI `gpt-4o-mini-tts` (voice: nova)

Under the OpenAI Terms of Use, ownership of the generated Output is assigned to
the user who created it. These assets are therefore redistributed here by the
project author under the same MIT terms as the code, and may be reused,
modified, and redistributed accordingly. When reusing them, comply with the
OpenAI usage policies (e.g. no unlawful or disallowed content).

No third-party copyrighted material and no personal data of any user (student
names, records, etc.) are included in this repository or its assets.
